ce Mapping","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/service-mapping/configure-mid-service-mapping.md","line":60},{"title":"Enable traffic-based discovery for CI types or specific CIs","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/service-mapping/t_CreateATrafficBasedDiscoveryRule.md","line":62},{"title":"Map application services using tags with classic Service Mapping","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/service-mapping/map-service-tag.md","line":63},{"title":"Create or customize patterns","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/discovery-and-service-mapping-patterns/t_CreatePatternPatDef.md","line":64},{"title":"Create entry point types for Service Mapping","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/discovery-and-service-mapping-patterns/t_CreateEntryPoint.md","line":65},{"title":"Enhance patterns without modifying identification sections","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/discovery-and-service-mapping-patterns/modify-pattern-using-extensions.md","line":66},{"title":"Service Mapping reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/it-operations-management/service-mapping/service-mapping-reference.md","line":68},{"title":"Domain separation","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/domain-sep-landing-page.md","line":73},{"title":"Domain separation recommended practices for service providers","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-security/bp-domain-sep-recom